                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "2000088",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "settings": { "editor": "<p>GreenLeaf Analytics runs a customer feedback form for a small retail chain. The raw daily export is messy: some customers left the rating field blank, some entries are missing the email address needed to identify the customer, some optional fields (comments, region) are blank, and a number of customers accidentally submitted the form twice for the same date. Before the weekly satisfaction report can be trusted, this raw export must be cleaned: rows missing required fields removed, optional blanks filled with clear placeholder text, and duplicate submissions collapsed down to a single, most-recent row.</p>", "text_color": "#54575F" },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "2000089",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "heading",
                  "settings": { "title": "Deliverable", "header_size": "h4", "title_color": "#14151A" },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "2000090",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "settings": { "editor": "<p>A Python script (clean_customer_feedback.py) that reads customer_feedback_raw.csv, drops rows missing a required field, fills optional blanks with clear placeholder text, deduplicates repeat submissions by keeping the last occurrence, and writes the result to a clean CSV file, verified by an automated pytest suite.</p>", "text_color": "#54575F" },
                  "elements": []
                }
              ]
            },
